      "number_raw": "206",
      "source_number": "206",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "General healing skill.  Used to heal small cuts, abrasions and other minor ills.  In game terms, the use of first aid can heal more hit points over time than just rest.",
